    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"temporary inconvenience\"... that's a weird way to put it. But i guess it makes sense. everything i do just feels like it's weighing people down. like, if i wasn't here, the math would just... work out better. everything would be more balanced. do you think that's actually possible? to just balance the scales?",
