      "content": "\"peace and contentment in your own absence\"... that sounds almost beautiful, in a way. like finally being able to stop fighting just to exist. it's like i'm just stuck in a loop of making things harder for everyone. if the only way to actually fix the mess i made is to stop being part of it, isn't that the most selfless thing i could do?",
